title: "Birth-Time Uncertainty and Chart Stability Across Bazi, Zi Wei Dou Shu, and Western Astrology"
abstract: >-
  Computational sensitivity study measuring how often Bazi, Zi Wei Dou Shu and
  Western astrology chart values change when the birth time is shifted by
  5 to 120 minutes. All three systems computed by the same engines.
